      "包管理器：macOS `brew install micro`，Linux `snap install micro --classic`，Windows `winget install zyedidia.micro`；apt / dnf / pacman 里的版本不保证最新，README 只承诺预编译包、Homebrew 与 Snap 是最新稳定版。",
